Vikings and the Samurais.

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:17.445
CLAYTON ENGLISH
Foam swords...

00:00:17.495 --> 00:00:18.316
LARPER
Clink!

00:00:18.558 --> 00:00:20.558
CLAYTON ENGLISH
Big battle sequences...

00:00:21.026 --> 00:00:22.064
LARPER
Clink! Clink!

00:00:23.347 --> 00:00:24.441
CLAYTON ENGLISH
It's awesome.

00:00:25.581 --> 00:00:27.194
LARPER
Clink! Clink!

00:00:28.224 --> 00:00:31.177
Clink...

00:00:31.459 --> 00:00:33.411
[Cheering]

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:36.487
